• To split the length-oriented curved objects into individual separate segments at the selected point, click
the point where you would like to split it up and select Split Up [segment]. This looks like this:
• To move the entire length-oriented curved object, click it once with the left mouse button and drag the
mouse up or down or left or right. You can also use the arrow keys to move the object one pixel at a
time or hold down Shift and press an arrow key to move the object one grid unit at a time.
• To delete the entire length-oriented curved object, click it once with the left mouse button and press
Delete.
